<title>USA: Sprint boosts workforce in Las Vegas.</title>
<headline>Sprint boosts workforce in Las Vegas.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sprint Corp on Wednesday said it is adding 250 new positions to its Las Vegas operations to support rapid growth of telecommunications services.</p>
<p>The additional jobs boost Sprint's investment in the area by $10 million in salary and benfits The company currently employs over 1700 people in Nevada.</p>
<p>Between 1996 and the end of this year, Sprint will invest an additional $250 million in its telecommunications network in Las Vegas. In the Las Vegas Valley, Sprint maintains over 600 miles of fiber-optic transmission lines and has 10 synchronous optical network rings to reroute traffic.</p>
</text>
